	"Perfecto con excelente, el city tour comuna 13 excelente servicio, por parte del conductor (Francisco) y el guía (Brian), sin palabras, que Chimba Medellín, ahhh no olviden pedir la bandeja paisa a la hora del almuerzo brutal!!!": "Absolutely excellent! The City Tour and Comuna 13 service was amazing, from the driver Francisco and guide Brian. What a fantastic city! Don't forget to order bandeja paisa at lunch—it was incredible!",
